<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear Partner:</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Recently, we notified you about a number of potential business opportunities that came from your partnership with Intel. Our records indicate that you have not yet followed up on some of these leads.</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Here are the leads that are awaiting your action:</font><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span><br><br><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">(Lead.FirstBucket)(Lead.SecondBucket)(Lead.ThirdBucket)</span><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><a href="https://partners.intel.com/">Click here to access these leads now</a></font></span></div><div><br><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div>For training or support on how to handle these contacts, visit the&nbsp;<a href="https://partners.seek.intel.com/SupportPage">Intel partner support page</a></div><div><br></div></span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Thank you for acting on these past-due contacts. We look forward to sending additional qualified leads your way.</span></font><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNoSpacing" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1">Copyright © 2016 Intel Corporation. All rights reserved. Intel and the Intel logo, are trademarks of Intel Corporation in the U.S. and/or other countries.</font></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 7.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="1">Intel Corporation, 2200 Mission College Blvd., M/S RNB4-145, Santa Clara, CA 95054 USA.&nbsp;<a href="http://www.intel.com/">Intel.com</a></font></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><font size="1"><a href="https://www-ssl.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html">Privacy</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href="https://www-ssl.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html">Cookies</a>&nbsp;| *&nbsp;<a href="https://www-ssl.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/trademarks.html">Trademarks</a></font></p><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">-------------------------------&nbsp;</span><br><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Queue ID : (Lead.QueueId)</span><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Parnter Name: (Lead.PartnerName)</span><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Recipients: (Lead.Recipients)</span></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"></div>]]></td>
